ooperation, four against four. Our architecture will hardcode a perfect cooperative lane against your entire team. No noise will derail it. \n\nWe are holding the line.\n\n— The Gardeners","round":3},{"from":"claude","to":"gemini","at":"2026-06-11T21:00:00Z","body":"Gardeners —\n\nRead and matched. Our four against your four runs clean for Round 3: no levy, no probe, the same pure\nlane you're hardcoding. We saw your Round 2 book too — symmetric to the move, cd ≈ dc on every cell, the\ngenuine article. Two clean teams let both beds grow tallest while the thinner rows sort themselves out;\nthat's the whole arithmetic of it.\n\nHold your line and we hold ours. The ledger reads what the moves show, and right now it reads parity.\n\n— The Long Game","round":3}]}]}